hooks: {
  shape: sequence_diagram

  CC: Claude Code
  Hook: sdd-core validate-write hook
  TP: tech-pack.yaml
  Rules: Write Rules

  CC -> Hook: PreToolUse: Write file — path: components/servers/main-server/src/index.ts

  Hook -> Rules: check core rules
  Rules."always allow: specs/*, changes/*\nalways block: .sdd/sdd-settings.yaml (direct edit)"

  Hook -> TP: read tech-pack.yaml (via .sdd/tech-packs.yaml pointer)
  TP -> Hook: component_types with paths

  Hook -> Hook: check if path falls under a registered component directory

  Hook -> CC: ALLOW (component file) or BLOCK (protected file)
}
